    "chunk_text": "us, & his nama w\u00e6s witodlice Iohannes. He w\u00e6s fram Gode asend \u00fe\u00e6t he secgan mihte so\u00f0e gecy\u00f0nysse, swa swa her \u00e6fter seg\u00f0 on \u00feisum Swa swa se d\u00e6gsteorra on d\u00e6gered up g\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6tforan \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan, swa scean Iohannes \u00e6tforan cristes N\u00e6s he na him sylf leoht, ac \u00fe\u00e6t he cydde gecy\u00f0nysse be \u00feam leohte. Se h\u00e6lend s\u00e6de be him on sumere stowe \u00fe\u00e6t he leohtf\u00e6t w\u00e6re beorhte lixende for \u00fean \u00fee he bodode Se H\u00e6lend s\u00e6de eac to his halgum apostolum, Vos estis lux mundi: Ge syndon middaneardes leoht, Paulus cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac to \u00feam geleaffullum: Hwilon ge w\u00e6ron \u00feeostru, nu ge syndon leoht on Gode; for \u00c6c ure eagan syndon gehatene leoht, ac hi naht ne geseo\u00f0 butan hi sum leoht habbon, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges Nu seg\u00f0 se godspellere be \u00feam so\u00f0an leohte, \u00f0\u00e6t so\u00f0e leoht w\u00e6s \u00fee onliht \u00e6lcne mannan \u00fee on \u00feisne \u00d0\u00e6t so\u00f0e leoht is ure leofa H\u00e6lend, \u00fee is him sylf leoht & onliht \u00e6lcne mann \u00fee his geleafan leoht on On middanearde he w\u00e6s, & \u00fees middaneard w\u00e6s eall geworht \u00feurh hine, & middaneard ne oncneow He w\u00e6s on middanearde \u00feurh his godcundnysse, & he com to middanearde \u00feurh his menniscnysse, & \u00d0\u00e6t syndon \u00fea ungeleaffullan men \u00f0e his ge",
